      "value": "@{64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2|full_name} Since this is making my worlds look very scuffed looking for a bunch of people right now, and idk how long this would take for VRChat to look into, I had to go ahead and update Murder 4 to change all the Text components to TextMeshProUGUI components for now.\n\nI do plan to update my other worlds as well, I guess TMPro is just better anyway.\n\nBut I do have some worlds that are just too old to update, and idk how many other old worlds this is affecting right now. If I see any more worlds with this scrambled text problem I can post them here.",
