  "details": "UnityEngine.Text components (Not TextMeshPro) have glitched-out looking text (See picture).\n\nI have no idea why, it seems to just happen to random clients. \n\nThe only consistently seems to be that, Re-joining the world does not fix it, and it happens to all text components in the world at the same time (but not always immediately).\n\nA lot of older worlds use the regular Text components instead of TextMeshPro, I really hope you can fix this one.",
